1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
I miss the games where you actually cared about your little creature

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,000
so I'm making one.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,200
it hatches from an egg you pick

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,400
it grows when you walk

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,000
it gets sleepy when you stop…

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,800
…and so happy when you're back

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,000
what was yours called?
